{"reviews":[{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-0","r":3.0,"t":"cute for a one time wear","x":"These are really pretty. I will give them that. I have had a couple of them, now, and they break VERY easily. If you are super duper careful I am sure they would be fine..but I had one that I tried to just take off and it broke from that little bit of extra stress to unclasp it. I am not aggressive or anything like that and don't apply any more pressure than what is needed. they just break REALLY easily and are not very easy to fix.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-1","r":5.0,"t":"It's a great piece and well crafted","x":"I purchased this piece because I needed a little flare for a new outfit that had a lot of white and navy. It's a great piece and well crafted. The 'owl wings' design reminded me a lot of the 'Snitch' from Harry Potter. Multilayer bracelets are amazing as they give the illusion of multiple bracelets without having to slip on a ton of pieces. It's an amazing piece and goes well with a lot of outfits.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-2","r":1.0,"t":"I know it was super inexpensive but to be that poorly made","x":"Can I used negative stars?  It is cute, but as I took it out of package the connector chain came off.  I really didn't need it so OK. The next day I went to clasp it to gift it up & the hook came off.  I think it will work with a ribbon to hold it together, but really?  I know it was super inexpensive but to be that poorly made, why bother?","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-3","r":5.0,"t":"Bought this for my niece and she loved it. We have ordered a few bracelets similar ...","x":"Bought this for my niece and she loved it. We have ordered a few bracelets similar to this and they are very cute. The only issue was that the clasp had come off and even though it was a bit annoying, it was no big deal, easy fix.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-4","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"I just my new Susenstone Handmade Love Owl wings Multlarer  it is so beautiful and looks great on my arm, I sure will let my family and friends know about this so they can get one too so thank you for letting me get this at a low discount.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-5","r":4.0,"t":"Good!! BUY IT","x":"Amazing for the price I got it!!! I'm completely in love with it, and plan on wearing it just about every day!! High recommend it! HOWEVER the angel wings came undone and I had to fix it which is why I knocked it down one notch!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-6","r":5.0,"t":"For a few bucks - Nice","x":"Really well made.  I guess I'm surprised. Not sure why but this one is terrific.  The clasp is on backwards but that's an easy fix.  I like it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-7","r":5.0,"t":"It was a beauitful looking braclet and my girlfriend loved it. (and along with some other people that ...","x":"It was a beauitful looking braclet and my girlfriend loved it. (and along with some other people that saw it)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-8","r":1.0,"t":"cheaply made","x":"The claps broke the moment i put it on. Very cheaply made.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-9","r":1.0,"t":"cheaply made","x":"The claps broke the moment i put it on. Very cheaply made.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-10","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous!","x":"I purchased this piece because I needed a little style for a new outfit that had a lot of new owl patterns. It's a great piece and well made. The 'owl wings' design reminded me a lot angel wings. Multilayer bracelets are amazing as they give the illusion of multiple bracelets without having to slip on a ton of pieces. It's an amazing piece and goes well with a lot of outfits.  I received this piece at a discount for an honest review.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-11","r":3.0,"t":"Not 5 individual bracelets","x":"This bracelet was just ok.  I really thought it would be 5 individual bracelets but it is all connected.  That means that at times it just doesn't lay right. It also means that you have to wear all 5 all the time and can't mix and match.  I received this product at a discount for my honest review.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-12","r":2.0,"t":"Dissatistisfied customer","x":"They break very easily very poor quality. I've bought at  least 5 or more and three has yet not broke but as I know soon will as the the others have.  They look beautiful and the idea of them seem stylish but very dissatisfied.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-13","r":3.0,"t":"Cute & fun, however","x":"Cute & fun, however, the quality isn't there. Being so cheap, you're not paying for quality either.  The clasp brought the first day and it fell off somewhere, nowhere to be found. Bummer as it was cute.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-14","r":2.0,"t":"Which is a shame because otherwise it is a nice bracelet. Live and learn","x":"The clasps broke the first day I put it on.  Which is a shame because otherwise it is a nice bracelet.  Live and learn.... Should have known by the price.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-15","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely","x":"Price was right, and shipping was free when I ordered this item. I ordered this for my niece but ended up keeping it for myself.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-16","r":1.0,"t":"not as I thought","x":"Front visibly is cute , but back chain and clasp may last an hour very cheeply made, I'm disappointed but will remake it","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-17","r":2.0,"t":"Broke after few wears","x":"Wore 2 maybe 3 times since I bought this and it broke not even the chain the actual bracelet part.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-18","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Absolutely loved this bracelet its so adorable but broke the second time I wore it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-19","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Was a little big around the wrist even when u put it to the tightest chain part.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2015"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-20","r":3.0,"t":"better attachments = better jewelry","x":"I like the design.  The loop holding on the clasp broke in the first 10 min.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-21","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your money or eagerly anticipate delivery on this one","x":"Don't waste your money or eagerly anticipate delivery on this one. It is so poorly made it broke before I could even get it on my wrist. It looks cheap; of course it was so I am not out much. The strands are not even like in this picture but just hang unevenly and tangle. Sorry. I rarely leave bad feedback but this one should be avoided.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-22","r":2.0,"t":"Cute design but came in broken and then when I ...","x":"Cute design but came in broken and then when I tried to return it, I had to pay for shipping myself which then costed more than what I paid for initially. Have never gotten a chance to wear it because of how broken it was and it seemed way too fragile to bother trying to fix it myself.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-23","r":1.0,"t":"Low Expectations","x":"Well, this was very cheap but I still thought I may be able to wear it a couple of times. I literally had it on for 30 minutes or less and the clasp broke. Very disappointed and so glad I didn't spend more money on it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B00ZW0ABG6-24","r":4.0,"t":"She loved it, but so did her mom","x":"Bought this for my granddaughter. She loved it, but so did her mom! Price was not expensive and will order more to keep on hand for those last minute gifts.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the bracelet pretty, cute, or beautiful in appearance.","cites":[1,2,3,5,8,11,13,14]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the clasp or connector breaks easily, often right away.","cites":[1,3,4,6,7,9,10,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the bracelet as cheaply or poorly made.","cites":[3,9,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers consider it good value or well made for the low price.","cites":[2,6,7,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the layers are all connected rather than separate bracelets, affecting how it lays.","cites":[2,11,12]}]},"qa":[]}